{"articleNo":"2574","sourceUrl":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=view&articleNo=2574&article.offset=0&articleLimit=10","title":"2010-2학기 타대학(군산대학교) 수학 신청 안내","writer":"국립금오공과대학교","writeDate":"2010.07.23","hit":"13247","attachments":[{"name":"타대학수학신청원및군산대수학허가신청서1.hwp","href":"https://www.kumoh.ac.kr/ko/sub06_01_01_01.do?mode=download&articleNo=2574&attachNo=1728"}],"contentHtml":"\n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\n                \n                \t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<!--StartFragment-->&nbsp;\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 13pt; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 20pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;군산대학교 수학 안내</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt\"><br></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;1. 지원자격 : 아래의 각 호에 해당하는 자</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">가. 본교 재학생으로서 2개학기 이상을 이수한 자.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp; &nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;나. 이수성적 평점평균이 3.0 이상인 자.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; &nbsp;다. 학칙에 의하여 징계 받은 사실이 없는 자.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;2. 수학기간 : 타대학에서 2개 학기(1년) 이내로 수학 가능.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;3. 제출서류 및 장소</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">가. 제출서류(첨부파일)&nbsp;: 타대학 수학 신청원, 수학허가신청서(군산대학교)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 12pt; TEXT-ALIGN: left\"><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; 나. 제출장소 : 종합학사행정실 </span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;4. 신청기한 : </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #0000ff; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">2010. 7. 27(화)까지</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;5. 수학기간 : 2010. 8. 30(월) ~ 12. 16(목)</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;6. 등록금 납부 : 소속대학교에 납부</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;7. 수강신청 : 추천서류에 의거 군산대학교 학사관리과에서 일괄 신청.</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;8. 개설과목 및 수업시간표 조회<br></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; COLOR: #282828; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">가. 군산대학교 홈페이지(</span><a href=\"http://www.kunsan.ac.kr/\" target=\"_self\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">http://www.kunsan.ac.kr</span></a><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">)를 접속 한다</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;나. 홈페이지 하단의 종합정보시스템메뉴 클릭 -&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">ID</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> 및 </span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">비밀번호</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\"> 입력&nbsp;<br>&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 학사서비스</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;- 수강관리 메뉴에서 개설과목 조회</span><span style=\"FONT-WEIGHT: bold; FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; TEXT-DECORATION: underline\">&lt;2010.7.22.(목)부터 조회 가능&gt;</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 180%\"><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 11pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 180%; FONT-FAMILY: &quot;굴림&quot;; LETTER-SPACING: -1.1pt\">※ 타 교생의&nbsp; 종합정보시스템 접속&nbsp; ID : 999999, 비밀번호 :9999999</span></p>\n<p class=\"HStyle0\" style=\"MARGIN-BOTTOM: 4pt; LINE-HEIGHT: 18pt\"><span style=\"